	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Scripsi per d. a <persName ref="p7547">Duro Lapide</persName> <note type="misc">[eher ein von Hertenstein aus <placeName ref="l300">Luzern</placeName> als ein Hertenstein aus <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName>, evtl. Dr. med. <persName ref="p7547">Philipp von Hertenstein</persName>]</note> de concilio, quod abominationem arbitror coram domino.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">De <placeName ref="l303">Magdeburgensibus</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>sic quidam ex <placeName ref="l284">Lipsia</placeName>: esse circumvallatos undique, ut exitus eis plane sit praeclusus; fame vincendos esse, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>non alia ratione.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Sed mox in die s. Viti venerunt ad d. <persName ref="p18137">Marpachum</persName> <placeName ref="l491">Argentinensem</placeName>, quae sic habent: imperatorem <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>exercitus hostium mandasse suis, ne per mensem cum <placeName ref="l303">Magdeburgensibus</placeName> velitentur.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Qua re intellecta <placeName ref="l303">Ma<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>gdeburgenses</placeName> armenta miserunt ad hostem famelicum; nam rerum penuria valde laborant, quo erumpente <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>per turmas in armenta protinus secuti sunt <placeName ref="l303">Magdeburgenses</placeName> et fortiter agentes occiderunt et ceperunt 4000 et <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>praedam suam gloriose in urbem reduxerunt.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Venit mox vir pius et doctus ad dominum <persName ref="p5957">Theobaldum Nigrum</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z8"/><placeName ref="l491">Argentinensem</placeName> ita referens: <placeName ref="l1534">Aquisgranum</placeName> adcurisse tres tabellionum suorum uno die et pariter ad hunc mo<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>dum nunciasse: <persName ref="p18250">Mauricium</persName> una cum 24 nobilibus praeteriisse <placeName ref="l2562">Prussiam</placeName> nocte d. <persName>Ioannis Baptistę</persName> et <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>cognitum a <placeName ref="l2562">Prutenis</placeName> male multatum, vulneratum et abductum in <placeName ref="l2562">Prussiam</placeName> captivum.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Ita vir ille.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">O<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>ptant omnes, ut res, si non sic evenerit, e vestigio tamen eveniat.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">De priore stratagemate comiti <lb xml:id="p1z12"/><persName ref="p19058">Georgio</persName> scriptum est ante dies plus minus octo, cuius literas <persName ref="p2916">Schertlius</persName> legit ac sparsit; ego tamen credere <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>non audebam; nunc fere credo.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">De posteriore putavi rumorem tantum esse; nunc propius accedit <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>animus, veritatem rei expectamus.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">O facinus egregium, si res ita evenisset.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Narratur de concionatore quodam, qui in exercitu <placeName ref="l1048">Brandeburgensis</placeName> palam clamarit: omnes, qui <placeName ref="l303">Magdeburgenses</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>persequantur, Christum ipsum persequi.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">At dum de re ista cogito, mittitur libellus, qui contionem talem continet, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>et est <persName ref="p18233">Illyrici</persName>.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Hęc ante concionem supplicatoriam, ne vacuus tabellio abiret.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale cum tuis in <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Christo.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutabis amicos omnes.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName> 4. iulii anno 1551.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8418">Os[<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>valdus] Myco[nius</persName><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>] tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>D. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>in domino suo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
